"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":10,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I couldn't fix the gate's refusal from the test side, so I changed no files. Round 2 of 3 is still refused on the same point.\n\n**What the gate names:** `ProductPageE2ETest#viewDetailsOpensTheProductsPageHeadedWithItsName` fails while waiting for `[data-test='product-card']` to appear.\n\n**What I found:** I ran `./gradlew test-e2e --rerun` on both `ProductPageE2ETest` and the older `SeededCatalogE2ETest`, which this story didn't touch. Both fail with the same 30-second timeout on `http://localhost:8080/products`. The failure happens while the catalogue page is still loading, before any line of the new test runs. The `test-e2e` task doesn't start the shop itself; its description says \"requires running application\", so it tests whatever is already running on :8080. That is not this checkout's seeded shop. I couldn't check what it is because the direct request to :8080 was blocked. `tasks/CAT-02/tests.md` already records the same finding from the earlier attempt today.\n\n**Why I didn't change the test:** The test and page objects aren't what's broken. Making it pass against the wrong shop would mean weakening the assertion, which the stage forbids. The other four criteria pass.\n\n**To get past the gate:** this checkout's shop needs to be running on :8080 when the gate runs. One of these:\n1. You stop whatever is on :8080 and start this checkout with `./gradlew bootRun` (or `docker compose up --build`), then re-run the gate.\n2. You let me start this checkout's shop and run the e2e test against it with `-De2e.baseUrl=http://localhost:<port>`. That proves the test goes green, but the gate itself still uses :8080.\n\nWhich do you want?","ttft_ms":2535,"type":"result","duration_ms":95283,"uuid":"520126a5-6fda-4337-9eea-bd8f208a16bf","ttft_stream_ms":2122,"time_to_request_ms":219,"first_content_frame_ms":2122,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
